    ],
    "text": "How to Understand the Information The \ufb02ow of information has never been as easy or wide-ranging as it is today. This paper proposes some models to explore the relationship between speed/\ufb02ow of information with inherent value of information."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000009",
    "issues": [
      "hyphen_join_review"
    ],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0000",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0001"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0001",
